Package: PhyloSOLIDvis
Title: Visualization Suite for PhyloSOLID Phylogenetic Trees
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Qing", "Yang", email = "qing.yang@westlake.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Westlake University", role = "cph"))
Description: Generate circular phylogenetic tree visualizations with integrated mutation heatmaps, cell annotations, and genotype flipping markers. Designed for PhyloSOLID output.
